{\fad(240,240)\bord1\1a&HFF&\3a&H88&\3c&H000000&}いつだって

443
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:03,100
{\fad(240,240)\bord1\1a&HFF&\3a&H88&\3c&H000000&}僕ら　ひとつなんだ

444
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:06,810
{\fad(240,240)\bord1\1a&HFF&\3a&H88&\3c&H000000&}さあ進もう！

